{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块最大号的白色主句，首先注意到粉色高亮的“心里又热了起来”；随后视线容易被第二块红色高亮、第三块紫色高亮和第四块绿色高亮吸引。右上角目录字号较小，不是主要入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"想起从前亲近自然的相处，重新产生对未来亲密关系的期待。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、怀念、期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他重新振作、想好好生活；但又担心还要等很久才能遇到亲近的人，最后决定即使没有这样的人也要好好生活，不再为了留住谁而忍受委屈。这个从期待到不安再到自我决定的变化，第一眼不容易完整抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线，红、紫、绿、粉色高亮分别强调不同情绪和信息。\",\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，尤其第四块包含条件、选择和态度转变。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起来才懂从怀念、重新振作到最终自我接纳的变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e534abe8-a497-45f7-81d0-dad4dc726abe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013849656777Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:39:14.156311+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ed04bb75b708664b3dad66e0c437938a3651c0bc7368077dd856d058687349c1", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8e